List all labels in a project.

Examples:
  # Using positional argument (recommended)
  paso label list 1

  # Using shorthand flag
  paso label list -p 1

  # Using git branch association
  paso label list

  # JSON output for agents
  paso label list 1 -j

  # Quiet mode (one ID per line)
  paso label list 1 -q

  # Long-form flags also supported
  paso label list --project=1 --json

Usage:
  paso label list [project-id] [flags]

Flags:
  -j, --json          Output in JSON format
  -p, --project int   Project ID (uses git branch association if not specified)
  -q, --quiet         Minimal output (IDs only)
